# Savior of the Small, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, return target creature
# card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to your hand." Bot1's graveyard holds Gray Ogre (mana value 3, the limit),
# Memnite (0), Hill Giant (4, one past the limit, discarded to Bot2's Thoughtseize) and Faithless Looting (not a creature card).
# Savior attacks on turn 3 (no vigilance) and is tapped at the second main phase. Hill Giant and Faithless Looting are refused as
# targets (the refusals); Gray Ogre is the target and goes to Bot1's hand while the others stay.

